  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 Financial management/accounts support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the assignment is assisting the HUMCIV unit with timely review of the most urgent (aging and complex) financial accounts as well as preparation of input to accounting notes to avoid an increasing back log of a very large portfolio of accounts, including many complex multilateral accounts. The support will assist and improve flow in operations and increase the ability to perform timely financial monitoring and compliance.</narrative>
  </description>
